message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Belgelik"
abstract: >-
  Personal, self-hosted and offline-first study environment for legal work:
  a PDF and video library, a legislation reader that parses law texts down to
  article, paragraph and subparagraph level, a study planner and note-taking,
  synchronized across devices. Flutter client (Android, iOS, macOS, Windows,
  Linux) and a Python/FastAPI server running on the user's own machine.
authors:
